  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of the members appointed as specified in RSA 490-C:2, who shall serve terms as specified in RSA 490-C:3.\n\nSource. #8939, eff 9-15-07; ss by #14542, eff 4-3-26",
